nt color=&quot;#5a6577&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;handtekening over de ruwe body vóór het parsen; replay-sleutel per Webex-event&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;strokeColor=#154273;fillColor=#e4ecf5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#142033;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="1063" width="500" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-76" value="&lt;b&gt;Secrets&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#5b4b8a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;crypto.py · db/credentials&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#5a6577&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;AES-256-GCM met HKDF-sleutel, recordnaam als associated data, alleen-schrijven in het portaal&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;strokeColor=#5b4b8a;fillColor=#ece8f6;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#142033;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1155" width="500" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-77" value="&lt;b&gt;Registratie&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#154273&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;webhook_registration.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#5a6577&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;register-webhooks: idempotent, Webex-webhooks per host-account, één WxCC-subscription&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;strokeColor=#154273;fillColor=#e4ecf5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#142033;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="555" y="1155" width="500" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-78" value="&lt;b&gt;Diagnose&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#154273&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;diagnostics.py · wxcc_config.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#5a6577&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;wxcc-check probeert elke call onschadelijk; wxcc-config-check leest de keten asset → flow → queue&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;strokeColor=#154273;fillColor=#e4ecf5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#142033;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="1155" width="500" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-79" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#5a6577&quot;&gt;Fouten van buiten worden korte codes (IntegrationError); antwoorden van providers komen nooit in logs. Elke poort heeft een fake in tests/fakes/.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#142033;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1253" width="1500" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>